<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia GDP up 1.2 pct in Q3, up 3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia GDP up 1.2 pct in Q3, up 3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT (seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>					  Q3 96   Q2 96   Q3 95</p>
<p> Change on previous quarter	 1.2     0.7     0.61</p>
<p> Change on year-ago quarter	 3.0     2.1     3.46</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
